public class I76_CameraBuilderAudit extends GhidraScript { public void run()throws Exception{PrintWriter out=new PrintWriter(new FileWriter(getScriptArgs()[0]));DecompInterface d=new DecompInterface();d.openProgram(currentProgram);for(long pc:new long[]{0x405970,0x405b90,0x4061b0,0x406920,0x406e00,0x406f30,0x407500,0x402b30,0x472220}){Function f=getFunctionContaining(toAddr(pc));out.println("\n===== "+Long.toHexString(pc)+" "+(f==null?"null":f.getName())+" =====");if(f==null)continue;DecompileResults r=d.decompileFunction(f,45,monitor);if(r.decompileCompleted())out.println(r.getDecompiledFunction().getC());}d.dispose();out.close();}}
